Version 1.3 (July 23rd 2026)
- Fix handling of certificates with GeneralizedTime dates (post-2049).
- Fix crash when invoked with no filename argument.
- Fix build with OpenSSL 4.
- Fix cron script to handle httpd -DDUMP_CERTS output with leading
  whitespace or non-file lines (#2).

Version 1.2 (May 23rd 2020)
- Add configure script.
- Add certwatch.cron(5) man page.
- Support "make install".

Version 1.1 (February 7th 2019)
- Code cleanups, man page improvements, added tests.
- Add --help option.

Version 1.0 (February 1st 2019)
- Initial upstream release, extracted from the Fedora crypto-utils package.
